/*
 * Palace pomegranate Garden — south of outside22.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original (TimeMsg, lily pond
 * drink/refill, pick pomegranate, sit/romp/search, east
 * garden4) is garden3_ldmud.lpc. Look at pond / lilies /
 * grove is flavour. Pick/drink/romp/search and east
 * garden4 are not loaded. Archive keeps “withing”,
 * “lavendar”, “perferred”, “pomegranates..”, and
 * “the the ripe”.
 */

